    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47307" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Syrŏphoenix</span></b> ,
			īcis, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Συροφοίνιξ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				Syrophœnician</i> (on the borders of Syria and
			Phœnicia), Lucil. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 397,
			27</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 8, 159 sq.</span></i>—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Syrŏphoenissa</span></b> , ae,
				f., <i><span class="en">Hier. in Isa. 5, 23,
			12</span></i>. </div>
